# Project: DotEnvUp

## What This Is

DotEnvUp is an open-source encrypted `.env` file format (`.env.up`) and tooling ecosystem. It makes secrets safe by default without changing how developers work.

**Tagline:** ".env files, but with memory — and a lock."

## Architecture

This repo (`sarhej/dotenvup`) is the **open-source format and tools** (MIT). It includes everything needed for local secret management: format, CLI, Node.js library, and VS Code/Cursor extension.

For team sharing, audit, and governance: [unknownpassword.com](https://unknownpassword.com).

