## Key Concepts

- **`.env.up` format**: Encrypted `.env` with cleartext metadata header (key names, versions, timestamps, authors) and encrypted values. "Half-open envelope." See `docs/SECURITY.md` and `docs/USER_GUIDE.md`. Types in `packages/format/src/index.ts`.
- **Lock/unlock UX**: Status bar button temporarily decrypts `.env.up` → generates standard `.env` → auto-locks after timer or process exit.
- **Zero code changes**: Existing `dotenv` libraries and `process.env` work unchanged. The `.env` file just appears/disappears.

