## Current State

CLI (`@dotenvup/cli`) and format (`@dotenvup/format`) are **implemented and production-ready** (except Windows testing). The VS Code extension is MVP — lock/unlock, import, status, show keys, key management, recovery. Repo builds clean and all tests pass (macOS, Ubuntu).

## For AI Agents

Full automation guide: [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) at repo root.

- **Never assume `.env` exists** — it may be locked. Use `up run -- <command>` to inject env.
- Use `up status` (or `up status --json`) to check lock state and drift.
- Prefer `up run -- <command>` when a command needs env (tests, build, run).
- In non-interactive use: `--yes`, `--force`, `--duration`, `--force-delete`, `--json`.
- Exit codes: `0` success, `1` user/usage error, `2` system error.
- Do not commit `.env`; `.env.up` is safe to commit.
